1
00:00:00,193 --> 00:00:02,351
Right now, there's something you're supposed to be doing.

2
00:00:02,351 --> 00:00:03,541
Why haven't you started?

3
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:06,087
You've known it for days — maybe weeks.

4
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:07,054
It sits there

5
00:00:07,054 --> 00:00:08,168
quietly judging you

6
00:00:08,168 --> 00:00:10,452
while you watch videos about getting things done.

7
00:00:10,452 --> 00:00:11,785
That is not laziness.

8
00:00:11,785 --> 00:00:12,847
That is your brain

9
00:00:12,847 --> 00:00:13,851
running a program.

10
00:00:13,851 --> 00:00:15,436
And programs can be rewritten.

11
00:00:16,265 --> 00:00:17,306
Over the next chapters

12
00:00:17,306 --> 00:00:19,725
why procrastination is an emotion problem

13
00:00:19,725 --> 00:00:20,871
not a time problem.

14
00:00:20,871 --> 00:00:22,353
The loop that keeps you stuck.

15
00:00:22,353 --> 00:00:25,096
And 5 tools, backed by real studies

16
00:00:25,096 --> 00:00:25,883
that break it.

17
00:00:25,883 --> 00:00:27,214
Stay until the end

18
00:00:27,214 --> 00:00:30,026
because the last one forgives your past failures.

19
00:00:30,026 --> 00:00:30,825
Literally.
